Code of Conduct

Our Pledge

We are committed to providing a welcoming and respectful environment for everyone.

Our Standards

- Be respectful and kind.
- Accept different opinions.
- Avoid offensive language.
- Support other community members.

Enforcement Responsibilities

Project maintainers are responsible for maintaining a safe and respectful environment.

Scope

This Code of Conduct applies to all project-related activities, including online discussions and contributions.

Enforcement

Unacceptable behaviour can be reported to the project maintainers.

Enforcement Guidelines

Maintainers may take appropriate action, including warnings or removal of contributions.

Attribution

This Code of Conduct is inspired by the Contributor Covenant.
